# TIMS Dictionary of Molinology -- permanent concept identifiers
#
# https://w3id.org/molinology/<id> redirects to the live resolver for
# that concept. The target below points at the pilot host
# (millthesaurus.org) today; it will be repointed to a TIMS-owned
# domain (thesaurus.molinology.org) once that is live, and could be
# repointed again in the future (e.g. to a static mirror) without
# anyone's existing /molinology/<id> links ever changing or breaking.
# This is deliberately a 302 (not 301) so browsers and crawlers never
# cache the redirect permanently, keeping that future repointing safe.
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# Bert Bulder (Hippo Software / Hippo WebDesign)
# info@bertbulder.nl
# GitHub username: bertbulder
#
# On behalf of: TIMS -- The International Molinological Society
# (Dictionary of Molinology)

RewriteEngine on
RewriteRule ^([0-9]+)/?$ https://millthesaurus.org/concept.php?id=$1 [R=302,L,QSA]
RewriteRule ^$ https://millthesaurus.org/ [R=302,L]
